WEBVTT

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.180
It's no use! Everyone, run!

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:12.960
Thanks for letting us know. But don't butt in with any more futile chatter.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.360
What's the matter, Foxy?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.360
Calvo?

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:43.090
Hey, hey, is the galaxy's strongest woman in tears over a bad dream?

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:48.370
Galaxy's strongest?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:53.140
Yeah. Your body is now the fastest and the strongest.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.710
The finest merchandise. Right?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.050
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:02.380
Assuming what you've told me isn't hot air, that is...

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.440
Hey, hey, trust me.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.030
Sir, you have a sharp eye.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.030
The AG-30 type here is great for general-purpose work,

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.270
yet it can be re-fitted with most optional devices,

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.270
and it is easily concealed...

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.370
How much for a battalion of them?

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.960
Yes, right this way.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.040
Are you trying to take advantage of me!?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:05.050
Sir, I do not know which frontier area you may have come from,

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:10.140
but unlike the open market, we have our own prices here.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:18.820
What do you think? This EG-52 F-Type is ideal for assassinations.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.680
You're weak! You're too weak, open challenge contestant!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:46.320
No, on the contrary, the former GCWA Champion, Mad Bad Bull,

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.020
is just too strong!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:52.660
With his reinforced Muscivemotors, his layers of Armorskin,

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.720
he can outdo even an armored mechanized soldier!

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:04.040
Now then, here comes the entrance of our next open challenge contestant.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:09.170
We ask you, please do not bore either us or the champion!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.080
Miss Beauty Aphrodia!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.850
Ta-da~a...

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:33.170
Posing as a battlecyborg... that sounds like <i>Éclair-san.</i>

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:35.340
But are you sure this will work?

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.070
If we can seize cyborg bodies that were stolen,

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.340
it will be irrefutable evidence.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:45.010
It's ironic that a high-speed reactor should become ironclad evidence.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:49.310
If you had gone along with her, it would have been easier to find them out.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.690
They said that children were not allowed in.

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:56.620
Then that leaves everything up to <i>Éclair-san,</i> huh?

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:10.970
<i>No, it's definitely not this one. But, better confirm it, just in case.</i>

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:29.960
<i>He's not the one, all right. Not if he can't keep up with this level of speed.</i>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.960
<i>I'll finish this once I've taken on enough of his techniques.</i>

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.410
What about you, sir? Mad Bad Bull?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.680
He features all sorts of reinforced parts that we offer...

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.680
No thanks. There's something else that I'm after.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.880
Oh, that is a shame.

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:28.610
<i>Sorry, but I can't stick around with you forever.</i>

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:56.010
It's over! The winner is Miss Beauty Aphrodia!!

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.200
Damn!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:07.020
We have another two hours before we're on.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:11.030
Would you like to play cards to pass the time?

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.660
It's a kind offer,

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.700
but I have no interest in keeping company with a double dealer at gambling.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.700
In that case, how about some vintage...

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.460
...grape juice?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.380
And now, the next contestant to appear...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.950
...is deserving of the expression "beautiful beast,"

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:37.210
as befits her name, Foxy Fox!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.890
What!?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.300
<i>This is the real item!</i>

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.970
This isn't what we agreed on!

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.640
Those female wrestlers, they have them.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.650
Everyone can see the mercantile value of those ultra-high-speed reactors.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.310
Doubling the price is asking too much!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:44.990
In that case, I never mentioned it. You're not the only customer out there.

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:47.320
Why, you! Don't tell me you'd go over to my enemies!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:52.480
Unfortunately for you, I'm not a soldier. I'm a businessman.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.920
Those moves...

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.830
There's no doubt about it.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.640
It couldn't be!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.690
Oh, man...

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:25.560
Hey, hurry it up!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.000
Are you all right?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.340
Yeah...

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:12.670
It's been a long time, Éclair.

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:18.350
It's you, all right. The red hair, the moves... you're Éclair, aren't you?

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:23.020
I'd never forget you, you GOTT dog!

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.690
GOTT?

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:29.690
T- that was many years ago! I don't know anything about my predecessor!

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:33.630
Don't play dumb! I still haven't paid you back for then!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.370
Wha?

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:55.380
Where is it!?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.380
I don't know!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.850
In any case, shut off the alarm!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:06.730
What!? A GOTT ES member?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.720
The Union Government's latest technology?

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.080
We're clear then, right?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.750
Regardless of who defeats her,

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.450
we will divide the orders that we accept equally among us.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.360
GOTT!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.920
That's far enough!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.700
It's no use.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.370
Have you been remodeled by Calvo too?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.710
Don't you know anything?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.440
They're dangerous goods, right? These reinforced parts?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.420
They're stolen goods!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.650
What's more, they're the Global Union's greatest secret.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:13.060
Calvo is dead! You are the only witness!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.530
Is that any of my concern!?

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.740
We take Foxy alive, right?

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.080
Heh, who cares?

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.480
The only things that will bring us any money are those top-secret devices,

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.350
after all!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.680
Looks like we've both become celebrities.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.040
Hold on!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.110
I'm sorry, but now that I have come by this power,

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.710
I have no desire to throw it away, you see?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:08.050
I'm going to become the GCWA champion, and earn myself a fortune.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.350
You would do anything for money, then?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:26.730
Have you... ever had to worry about having anything to eat for tomorrow?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:32.010
When I was a child... I sold out my friends, and let them die,

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.470
for just a tiny amount of money.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.010
There are still children who do things like that.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:42.210
With the money I make, I'm going to help those children...

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.360
It's not as though doing so will get rid of poverty.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.030
I know that!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:54.720
But it should at least help in getting rid of those kinds of children.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:05.000
That could be delightful, being able to fight on behalf of someone else, huh?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.730
Sheesh! Maybe I overdid it.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.730
No, that isn't the case.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:32.670
Yeah. That wasn't nearly enough.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:33.960
Damn!

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.680
What guarantee do I have that we'll be getting out of here safely?

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.010
None at all.

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:46.350
Can't you let me keep this power?

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.350
That's not possible.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:49.680
Can you even guarantee my life?

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.020
Even if I have to exchange my own life for it!

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:54.720
You are not cut out to be a civil servant!

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.360
Where are we headed?

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.700
To the outer hull emergency escape pods!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:06.700
What? We'll be shot down right away in those things!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.000
In the area of space around this station,

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.370
there's some magnetic turbulence that lasts for five minutes every 57 hours.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.040
That's when our chance will be.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.140
While everyone's visual sensors are confused,

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.710
my partner will come in our ship to rescue us.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.720
Partner? Then you only have one other in your group?

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.390
I'm telling you, it'll be packed with armed cops,

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.720
so it'll be impossible for you to take it over and escape!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.060
You're lying.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.390
H- how do you know?

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:31.660
GOTT is not the police.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.460
There will be a support unit there!

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.340
This is a shortcut?

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:44.170
It's above here. Hurry, we only have ten minutes left.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.350
Lethal mode...

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:56.680
What?

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:00.680
It means that this guy is a pure killing machine!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.450
- You can't mean it! - I'm counting on you!

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.030
Now!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.590
Are you all right?

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.680
That went pretty well.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.900
It is time.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.310
Lumiere, where are you?

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.320
120 seconds until arrival.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.650
Hurry!

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.780
Okay.

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.990
There aren't any cops on board, are there?

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:43.580
Feel free not to believe me!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.490
Foxy!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.630
Go on!

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.370
60 more seconds!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.660
Go on, I said!

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:16.350
Why didn't you run away?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.340
I was calling in a police squad.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.690
Éclair, hurry! Only 30 seconds left!

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:28.130
Okay, Lumiere! We're coming now, together with a police squad!

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:51.990
The birth of this champion heralds a new era for the GCWA!

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:56.980
Her name, Silver Rex!!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.670
Congratulations, champion!

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.470
T- thanks...

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.010
Um, have we met before somewhere?

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.010
It's Silver Rex!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.740
Wow! Can I have your autograph?

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:10.810
<i>The exhaustion of the body seeks only for a moment of tranquility.</i>

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:16.150
<i>However, that one instant of rest is always backed by danger.</i>

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:20.410
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
